29
00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.100
In this case, a click event.

30
00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.433
And then, we can just use 
a method to pass into our Listener

31
00:01:47.433 --> 00:01:49.666
so we can actually just
use our SetDifficulty().

32
00:01:51.733 --> 00:01:55.466
So, when our Button is clicked,
then it will go

33
00:01:55.466 --> 00:01:57.466
into the SetDifficulty() method,

34
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:01.266
and then we should see
which Button was clicked.

